The following is about the purchase process, which starts when you enter the order details.
Once the details of the purchase are entered you need to create a receiving report.
Once a receiving report occurs, the next tasks should be doubling a three-way match and collecting the receiving report. This should be done in parallel.
When the doubling check is completed a three-way match, confirming all the documents have been amended must be done
